<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Livraison confirmée - Recyclum</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        body {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f6f8fa 0%, #e9ecef 100%);
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        .client-card {
            max-width: 550px;
            margin: 2rem;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .client-card-header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #16C669 0%, #12a356 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 2rem;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .client-card-header h1 {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .client-card-body {
            padding: 2rem;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .success-icon {
            font-size: 5rem;
            color: #16C669;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            animation: scaleIn 0.5s ease-out;
        }
        @keyframes scaleIn {
            0% { transform: scale(0); }
            50% { transform: scale(1.2); }
            100% { transform: scale(1); }
        }
        .appointment-box {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(22, 198, 105, 0.1) 0%, rgba(22, 198, 105, 0.05) 100%);
            border: 2px solid rgba(22, 198, 105, 0.3);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            margin: 1.5rem 0;
        }
        .appointment-label {
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            color: #6c7783;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }
        .appointment-date {
            font-size: 1.75rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: #16C669;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }
        .appointment-info {
            color: #6c7783;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
        }
        .delivery-address {
            background: #f8fafc;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 1.25rem;
            margin: 1.5rem 0;
            text-align: left;
        }
        .delivery-address h4 {
            font-weight: 700;
            margin: 0 0 0.75rem 0;
            color: #0f1418;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }
        .delivery-address p {
            margin: 0;
            color: #6c7783;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .next-steps {
            background: #eff6ff;
            border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6;
            border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
            padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
            margin: 1.5rem 0;
            text-align: left;
        }
        .next-steps h4 {
            font-weight: 700;
            margin: 0 0 0.75rem 0;
            color: #1e40af;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }
        .next-steps ul {
            margin: 0;
            padding-left: 1.25rem;
            color: #1e40af;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
        }
        .next-steps li {
            margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
        }
        .btn-home {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #16C669 0%, #12a356 100%);
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 0.875rem 2rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: 700;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }
        .btn-home:hover {
            color: white;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(22, 198, 105, 0.3);
        }
        .order-number {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #f1f5f9;
            padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-family: monospace;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            color: #475569;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="client-card">
    <div class="client-card-header">
        <h1><i class="fa fa-check-circle"></i> Livraison confirmée</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="client-card-body">
        <div class="success-icon">
            <i class="fa fa-calendar-check"></i>
        </div>

        <h2 style="font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Votre date de livraison est confirmée !</h2>
        <p style="color: #6c7783; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
            Merci {{ order.deliveryFirstName }} !
        </p>
        <span class="order-number">{{ order.orderNumber }}</span>

        <div class="appointment-box">
            <div class="appointment-label">Date de livraison</div>
            <div class="appointment-date">
                {{ order.deliveryAppointment.formattedDate }}
            </div>
            <div class="appointment-info">
                Entre 9h et 18h
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="delivery-address">
            <h4><i class="fa fa-map-marker-alt"></i> Adresse de livraison</h4>
            <p>
                {{ order.deliveryFirstName }} {{ order.deliveryLastName }}<br>
                {{ order.deliveryStreet }}<br>
                {% if order.deliveryStreetComplement %}{{ order.deliveryStreetComplement }}<br>{% endif %}
                {{ order.deliveryPostalCode }} {{ order.deliveryCity }}<br>
                <i class="fa fa-phone"></i> {{ order.deliveryPhone }}
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="next-steps">
            <h4><i class="fa fa-info-circle"></i> Prochaines étapes</h4>
            <ul>
                <li>Un email de confirmation vous a été envoyé</li>
                <li>Vous serez contacté la veille de la livraison pour confirmer un créneau horaire</li>
                {% if order.deliveryType == 'with_installation' %}
                <li>Notre technicien procédera à l'installation et la mise en service</li>
                {% endif %}
                <li>Pensez à préparer l'emplacement de votre appareil</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <a href="{{ path('app_home') }}" class="btn-home">
            <i class="fa fa-home"></i> Retour à l'accueil
        </a>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
